        <name>start</name>
        <qualifiedname>ndigo_gating_block::start</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>The time from the first input signal seen in the idle state until the gating output is set. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><computeroutput>start</computeroutput> needs to be &gt;=0 and &lt;2^16.</para>
<para><computeroutput>start</computeroutput> must be set to a value &lt;= <ref refid="structndigo__gating__block_1a6c0af9f2e97842405fb15ed952ef2976" kindref="member">stop</ref>.</para>
<para>In multiples of 3.2ns. </para>
        </detaileddescription>
        <inbodydescription>
        </inbodydescription>
