        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>sources</name>
        <qualifiedname>ndigo_gating_block::sources</qualifiedname>
        <briefdescription>
<para>A bitmask with a bit set for all trigger sources that can trigger this gating block. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>The bits correspond to the same defines listed in <ref refid="structndigo__trigger__block_1a09bf0a0c15c4905391944154b116a637" kindref="member">ndigo_trigger_block::sources</ref>.</para>
<para>The gating blocks cannot use the digital trigger as as a source, that is, bitmasks <ref refid="group__sourcedefs_1gab668920b021ca846bca24b7cfbb66714" kindref="member">NDIGO_TRIGGER_SOURCE_TDC_PE</ref> to <ref refid="group__sourcedefs_1ga5058bd6fdb5e3eaf6ab6e54942658d56" kindref="member">NDIGO_TRIGGER_SOURCE_BUS3_PE</ref> </para>
        </detaileddescription>
